  "id": "file-convert",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": "文件转换",
  "symbol": "arrow.triangle.2.circlepath",
  "description": "在 Jarvis「文件」里转换文件格式：长按图像、音频、视频、文本或办公文档，转盘上的「格式转换」向外展开一圈此刻转得了的格式，选一个就转，产物放回当前文件夹。用 macOS 自带的工具，装了 FFmpeg、ImageMagick、pandoc、LibreOffice 时转得更多。",
  "author": {
    "name": "fusionseek",
    "github": "fusionseek"
  },
  "main": "dist/extension.js",
  "sdk": "^2.14.0",
  "minimumJarvisVersion": "3.3.2",
